<title>UK: SQUASH-SUPER SERIES FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-SUPER SERIES FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HATFIELD, England 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Super Series Finals on Saturday:</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat Brett Martin (Australia)  9-7 9-5 9-2</p>
<p>Third place playoff</p>
<p>Simon Parke (England) beat Ahmed Barada (Egypt) 9-7 9-2 5-9 5-9 9-2.</p>
</text>
